    "cols": 42,
    "rows": 24,
    "cell": 24,
    "_comment": "24px cells and a 1008x576 world. A 48px character is exactly a twelfth of the map's height, which is what the brief asked for. The paintings are 2688x1520, so the world is the image at 0.375 across and 0.379 down - a 1% vertical stretch, invisible, and it buys a grid whose cells are square."
